.TH LIBUTF8_IS_CONTINUATION 3 LIBUTF8
.SH NAME
libutf8_is_continuation - Test whether a byte is a UTF-8 codepoint continuation byte

.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <libutf8.h>

int \fBlibutf8_is_continuation\fP(char \fIc\fP);
.fi
.PP
Link with
.IR -lutf8 .

.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.BR libutf8_is_continuation ()
function tests whether a byte is a UTF-8 codepoint continuation byte.

.SH RETURN VALUE
The
.BR libutf8_is_continuation ()
function returns 1 if the predicate is true, and 0 otherwise.

.SH ERRORS
The
.BR libutf8_is_continuation ()
function cannot fail.

